{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has suspended development for the time being. We plan to start over as an ARPG using the world of <strong>SilverQuest: Gaiden</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you purchase this game, please be aware that it will change a lot in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SilverQuest: Gaiden</strong> was originally started as &quot;miniflake&quot; in 2009, released as a solo project by I-GAME-ART, the game was launched into alpha state on a website called Desura, and later Steam. Wolfgame came on to do additional artwork and design in 2012. The goals were to create a deeply expandable roguelike with a classic black and white design. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, that did not come to plan as I-GAME-ART had to stop working on the game and games in general around 2012. Since then, the game has been frozen in time on Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current game and its source code will be released at a later date.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/333380?t=1746560072","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/333380?t=1746560072","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/333380/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746560072","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/333380/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746560072","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has suspended development for the time being. We plan to start over as an ARPG using the world of <strong>SilverQuest: Gaiden</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you purchase this game, please be aware that it will change a lot in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SilverQuest: Gaiden</strong> was originally started as &quot;miniflake&quot; in 2009, released as a solo project by I-GAME-ART, the game was launched into alpha state on a website called Desura, and later Steam. Wolfgame came on to do additional artwork and design in 2012. The goals were to create a deeply expandable roguelike with a classic black and white design. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, that did not come to plan as I-GAME-ART had to stop working on the game and games in general around 2012. Since then, the game has been frozen in time on Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current game and its source code will be released at a later date.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["I-Game-Art"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/333380/header.jpg?t=1746560072","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Wolfgame 2014","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/333380/27525/06c53ffb73c39072000fa241cea728b462a55d64/1751265232/dash_av1.mpd?t=1447365079","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/333380/27525/06c53ffb73c39072000fa241cea728b462a55d64/1751265232/dash_h264.mpd?t=1447365079","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/333380/27525/06c53ffb73c39072000fa241cea728b462a55d64/1751265232/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1447365079","id":2035546,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2035546/movie480.mp4?t=1447365079","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/203554